--- !u!114 &1127491738
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1127491736}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1b1c8d611d82167d5a261b2356e2656d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PromptResponses
  m_RequiredLayer: 1
  m_bIsLevelSource: 0
  m_KeywordsSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2943e3a8b8c6e6ab58b3253a588c936e, type: 2}
  m_BaseKeywordsSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dfaec42fbfd441e4b036f21e916b82c7, type: 2}
  m_PromptResponseEntries:
  - m_Keywords:
    - look
    - around
    - area
    - inspect
    m_Response: 'You take a better look at the broken Bridge. The fact that any of
      the Bridge is standing at all is shocking.


      The wood is beaten, likely
      eroded and weathered from decades of rain and storms. You can see bits and
      pieces of the Bridge crashed down on the rocks in the valley below.


      However,
      far off in the distance you could swear that you hear the sound of evil laughter....but
      was that just your imagination?


      What do you do?'
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 40
    m_bAdvancesLayer: 0
    m_LayerToAdvanceTo: 0
    m_GatingObject: {fileID: 0}
    m_PresenceRequirement: 0
  - m_Keywords:
    - cross
    - walk
    - across
    - bridge
    m_Response: 'In spite of the fact that there is a massive chasm, you attempt
      to cross the "Bridge".


      You notice that the gap is maybe 50 feet wide,
      this would be impossible for you to jump; even with a running start.


      You
      decide against trying to cross after all.


      What do you do?'
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 30
    m_bAdvancesLayer: 0
    m_LayerToAdvanceTo: 0
    m_GatingObject: {fileID: 0}
    m_PresenceRequirement: 0
  - m_Keywords:
    - laughter
    - listen
    m_Response: 'You concentrate and try to focus on the laughter, attempting to
      discern if it is real or imaginary.


      After some time and a bit of silence,
      you hear it again. It is certainly no illusion, the laughter is real and it
      seems to be coming from the Wizard''s Tower.


      Unfortunately, you cannot
      get there because the Bridge is in pieces.


      What do you do?'
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 50
    m_bAdvancesLayer: 0
    m_LayerToAdvanceTo: 0
    m_GatingObject: {fileID: 0}
    m_PresenceRequirement: 0
  - m_Keywords:
    - climb
    - valley
    - gulley
    m_Response: 'You climb down the cliff face into the valley. You see there are
      shards of wood splintered on the rocks -- seems like the bridge collapsed a
      while ago.


      You do also see there are some small creature bones, like
      a chicken''s leg. It''s difficult to tell exactly what they are.


      Not
      eager to find out why there are bones, you climb back up the cliff face where
      you started.


      What do you do?'
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 30
    m_bAdvancesLayer: 0
    m_LayerToAdvanceTo: 0
    m_GatingObject: {fileID: 0}
    m_PresenceRequirement: 0
  m_TransitionEntries:
  - m_Keywords:
    - travel
    - transition
    - move
    - go
    - cave
    m_Response: You decide to leave the Bridge area and head to the Cave.
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 60
    m_TargetLevelID: 3
  - m_Keywords:
    - travel
    - transition
    - move
    - go
    - glade
    m_Response: You decide to leave the Bridge area and head back to the Glade.
    m_RequiredIntentThreshold: 60
    m_TargetLevelID: 1
  m_EyeOpenEntries: []
  m_FallbackResponse: Nothing happens.
  m_IntroResponse: 'You exit the Glade and make your way to a dilapidated and broken
    Bridge.


    Across the gulley you can see what appears to be a Cemetery, and
    further still the Wizard''s Tower, looming over the area.


    Unfortunately
    it seems like you cannot cross the Bridge.


    What do you do?'
  m_Variations: []
